      "id": "2a0afa2ab9d6e7e933391972cebeb54b20d4ed8b75994ff28514e6051496e4bd",
      "title": "#1562 | Decisão do STJ que autoriza suspender CNH de devedores é de 2025; e mais",
      "url": "https://www.aosfatos.org/noticias/decisao-stj-suspender-cnh-devedores-2025",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-21T17:59:11.193Z",
